s10-6-p19 : Block
s10-6-p19 = prose (cons "A program may include a kernel, driver, client, server, network, and the computations that install or change them. The handler construction in §7.6 gives one precise way to internalize selected interactions and leave the rest open. A compiled realization can consist of multiple artifacts; its relation to the source computation depends on the semantics and correctness evidence for those artifacts. The trading-fleet example is one possible application of this general construction, not an additional language facility." nil)
